data.content:
**Fix applied.** The `out` parameter overload was removed in MSTest v4. The replacement pattern is:

```csharp
// Before (broken):
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>(obj, out var typed);

// After:
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>(obj);
var typed = (T)obj;
```

The assertion validates the type; since it passes, the subsequent cast is safe. All 3 tests build and pass.
